# 🔐 GitHub Security

The following files/directories should not be committed:

```text
.env
venv/
qdrant_data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
```

Recommended `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
venv/
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
qdrant_data/
.vscode/
```

